[[2047,31,32768,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The power socket / cigarette lighter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is supplied (at\npin 2) by the line controlled by the ignition (INT/A) for the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected\nby the fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : both are housed in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pin 3 of socket\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              provides the\nearth from \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>C20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The ring nut for the power socket is lit\nup (at pin 1) when the side lights are on by means of the line coming\nfrom the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               switch and is protected\nby the controls illumination fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the\nadditional fuse unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99.</p><p>The same supply line with the side lights\non also lights up the ashtray light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]